# Trigger this drone's own report_target_detected() through the real code
# path (self-bid + broadcast to the fleet), instead of faking a detection by
# publishing directly onto the topic from outside the node. A node never
# receives its own published topic messages, so an external `ros2 topic
# pub` onto /drone_X/coordination/target_detected only reaches the OTHER
# drones — it skips the detecting drone's own self-bid entirely. Calling
# this service is what perception code (or a test) should do instead.
geometry_msgs/Point position
string target_type
float32 confidence
---
uint32 target_id
